      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خُضَعَةٌ</span></b>  A man (S) <i>who is lowly, humble,</i> or <i>submissive, to everyone.</i> (S, Sgh, K,) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And One
<i>who overcomes,</i> or <i>subdues, his adversaries,</i> or
<i>opponents,</i> (K, TA,) <i>and humbles and abases
them.</i> (TA.)

